    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The regression that made the valid **Leave Fire** prompt disappear was the broad `INPUT_CONTEXT_B` suppression. That broad F suppression is gone in the installed build: Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101 now targets only Rockstar's exact teardown prompt/action, so the ordinary F used to leave the fire is no longer touched.\n\nPlease test these Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101 behaviors in the installed build:\n- F leaves the fire normally.\n- The vanilla **Tear Down Camp** prompt is absent at authored camps.\n- The camp kit remains absent from the free-roam radial and returns when a mission requires it.\n\nThe separate F3 campsite creation/removal ScriptHook crash is tracked as Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#255 and remains `actionable`; I am not presenting that crash as fixed by this Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#101 change.",
